- How would you test idempotency and race conditions between Cosmos and Blob writes?
- How would you adjust for larger payloads or higher throughput?

## Why This Is Asked
Evaluate ability to implement observability across heterogeneous runtimes in Azure, with end-to-end tracing and cross-service propagation.

## Key Concepts
